OL,3,AIran rejects French claims it was
OL,4,Abehind supermarket fridge hacking
OL,5,
OL,6,FIran has described French accusations
OL,7,Fthat it was behind cyber-attacks that
OL,8,Fraised the temperatures of supermarket
OL,9,Ffridges and freezers as "baseless and
OL,10,Fhostile".
OL,12,FOn Monday, the French authorities
OL,13,Fblamed Iran's Islamic Revolutionary
OL,14,FGuard Corps (IRGC) for the string of
OL,15,Fhacks, which foreign minister Jean-Noel
OL,16,FBarrot said were "unprecedented" in
OL,17,Fterms of their scale and "level of
OL,18,Faggression".
OL,20,FHe added that those responsible would
OL,21,Fbe hit with sanctions.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
