OL,3,AIran rejects French claims it was
OL,4,Abehind supermarket fridge hacking
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe French cyber-attacks, which led to
OL,7,Fthe destruction of tons of frozen and
OL,8,Fchilled food, were followed by a
OL,9,Fsimilar hacks against supermarkets
OL,10,Facross several other European
OL,11,Fcountries. It is not known if the
OL,12,Finstances are linked.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
